## Note on third-party components

This repository contains code that depends on, but does not redistribute:

- **PyTorch** (BSD-3-Clause), **timm** (Apache-2.0), **OpenCV**
  (Apache-2.0), **NumPy** (BSD-3-Clause), **scikit-learn** (BSD-3-Clause),
  **pycocotools** (BSD-2-Clause). See `requirements.txt` for pinned versions.

The trained weights published as release assets are derived from
ConvNeXt-Small initialised with ImageNet weights
(`convnext_small.fb_in22k_ft_in1k`, Apache-2.0 via timm).

## Note on competition data

The MAGFiLO dataset is **not** included in this repository and is not covered
by the MIT license above. It is distributed by the competition organisers under
**CC BY-NC 4.0** (non-commercial, academic use only). Download it from
<https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/filament-segmentation-2026>.

The GONG H-alpha observations underlying the competition images are courtesy of
the NSF National Solar Observatory (NSO) Integrated Synoptic Program, operated
by AURA under a cooperative agreement with the National Science Foundation.
